{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t一名日前在馬鞍山失蹤的84歲男子已被尋回。他沒有受傷，案件沒有可疑。<br/>\n<br/>\n該名男子本月15日離開耀安邨的住所後失蹤，家人報案。他昨日下午在鞍祿街一公園被尋回。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:07.896500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:58:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:39.448062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:34.455874+00:00","content_hash":"af058d3026f5ae1679070443fbd7775c27fe3136b2e795d79c17e0d6975a0cdb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}